setup_notes.content:
Create `~/.config/ovos_persona/jarvis.json`:

{
  "name": "Jarvis",
  "solvers": [
    "ovos-solver-jarvis-plugin"
  ],
  "ovos-solver-jarvis-plugin": {
    "webhook_url": "http://127.0.0.1:5677/webhook/3eb829d2-c64c-479e-a0e2-ed6f7d1aa052",
    "timeout": 10
  }
}

### n8n webhook note

- `/webhook-test/` is meant for n8n workflow testing
- `/webhook/` is the production endpoint used when your workflow is active
